      "writtenOn": "2023-07-31T08:09:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m okay to go with this CL. Building something similar to `LifecycleOwner` seems to replicate wheels. And the change here is reasonable IMO, `#isResumed` is just like other isXXX method (e.g. `#isTopOfTask`, `#isFinishing`, or `#isDestroyed`) that can return the current activity state.",
      "parentUuid": "bb6dd1a0_ae55db2d",
      "revId": "1250f17dffab41880b2f7c4b78d9754a83dab84a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
